---
import Icon from '../ui/Icon.astro'
---

<section id="como-funciona" class="relative px-4 py-12 bg-linen-50">
  <div class="container mx-auto">
    <div class="mb-20 text-center">
      <h2 class="mb-6 text-3xl font-semibold lg:text-5xl">
        ¿Cómo funciona KiraKana?
      </h2>
      <p class="max-w-xl mx-auto text-lg text-copper-100 text-pretty">
        Aprende <strong class="text-ochre-200">hiragana</strong>
        y <strong class="text-cyan-900">katakana</strong>
        con un método interactivo en tres pasos: estudia los caracteres, practica
        con ejercicios y mide tu progreso, todo en un solo lugar.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="flex items-center justify-center mb-20 flex-wrap">
      <a href="#paso-aprende" class="flex items-center gap-3 px-7 py-4 border-b-2 border-b-transparent hover:border-b-sun-100">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center size-12 rounded-full bg-sun-100">
          <Icon name="learn" />
        </div>
        <span class="text-copper-100 tracking-wide">Aprende</span>
      </a>
      <div class="w-12 h-px bg-copper-200 hidden md:block"></div>
      <a href="#paso-practica" class="flex items-center gap-3 px-7 py-4 border-b-2 border-b-transparent hover:border-b-sun-100">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center size-12 rounded-full bg-bark-100">
          <Icon name="practice" class="text-mauve-50" />
        </div>
        <span class="text-copper-100 tracking-wide">Practica</span>
      </a>
      <div class="w-12 h-px bg-copper-200 hidden md:block"></div>
      <a href="#paso-progresa" class="flex items-center gap-3 px-7 py-4 border-b-2 border-b-transparent hover:border-b-sun-100">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center size-12 rounded-full bg-ochre-100">
          <Icon name="progress" class="text-mauve-50" />

        </div>
        <span class="text-copper-100 tracking-wide">Progresa</span>
      </a>
    </div>
